WEBVTT

00:00:00.102 --> 00:00:04.915
An ELSE branch in a case expression is optional If
there is

00:00:04.941 --> 00:00:08.459
no ELSE and none of the WHEN conditions match SQL
returns null

00:00:09.376 --> 00:00:13.422
Sometimes that is exactly what we want But it should
be a

00:00:13.448 --> 00:00:19.363
deliberate decision not an accident In this example
only selected respiratory

00:00:19.376 --> 00:00:24.878
diagnoses receive the label Respiratory Other
diagnoses receive null because

00:00:24.891 --> 00:00:29.740
there is no ELSE branch Run the SQL in the browser
and

00:00:29.765 --> 00:00:34.934
inspect the diagnosis group column You can also copy
it into pgAdmin

00:00:36.346 --> 00:00:40.535
Then think about the purpose of the output Would
null be meaningful

00:00:40.561 --> 00:00:43.744
here or would a label such as Other be easier for
users

00:00:43.770 --> 00:00:47.919
to understand The answer depends on the business
rule and how the

00:00:47.932 --> 00:00:49.156
result will be used
